(text "Place R(22k) immediately after connector, clamp between the two resistor stages, and R(24k9)+CDIFF at U1.\nExternal clamps are fully connected and fitted. ESD pulse survivability and leakage still require physical testing.\nDo not fit common-mode capacitors in RevA: mismatch creates a path from common mode into differential signal." (at 20 268 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid "682edff2-bbd2-505c-ab1c-9b66cd7f9570"))
